shared_parser_labelled_values.reason for change:
This CR is to introduce Rx BSF optimization for NR RRM Ph5 as requested by RAN4 in LS R2-2503326 and R2-2506739. The related features include:
The configuration of triggering conditions for L3 fast beam sweeping (FBS) operation;
UAI to indicate UE preference for FBS operation.

